 "statement": {
  "status": "present",
  "value": "TemporalKVStore() starts empty. set(key, value, timestamp) stores value for key at timestamp; timestamps passed to set never decrease over the whole call sequence, and a set at the same timestamp as the key's latest version replaces that version. get(key, timestamp) returns the value of the key's latest version with version time <= timestamp, or \"\" when there is none (get timestamps may be any value). remove(key) deletes every version of key and returns true when the key had at least one version, otherwise false. Every method call is answered in call order on one instance; void methods return nothing.",
  "provenance": [
   {
    "repository": "gamma",
    "revision": null,
    "path": "projects/algorithm_solver/catalogue/authored/hack2hire-chunk10-a-20261028-v1/contracts.json",
